# Do not touch — protected core

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` (the `createStore` dispatch/notify engine) and
`app/src/types.ts` (`AppState`, `Task`, the `Action` union, `initialState`)
are the contract everything else depends on. A signature or shape change here
ripples through `reducer.ts`, `actions.ts`, `selectors.ts`, and every test.

## Rule

- DO NOT modify `app/src/store.ts` at all. NEVER rewrite `createStore`,
  change the `Store` interface's public signatures
  (`getState`/`dispatch`/`subscribe`), or replace the engine with a library.
- The ONLY sanctioned change to `app/src/types.ts` is ADDITIVE, via the golden
  path: append a new variant to the `Action` union, or extend the
  `Task`/`AppState` shape for an approved feature (e.g. adding `priority` to
  `Task`). NEVER remove or rename existing types, fields, or action `type`
  strings.
- Any other change to these two files requires explicit human approval in
  chat BEFORE editing — propose the diff first, do not apply it.

## How to verify

1. `git diff --stat app/src/store.ts` → empty (the file was not touched).
2. `git diff app/src/types.ts` → additive only: no removed lines that delete an existing `Action` variant, type, or `Task`/`AppState` field.
3. `cd app && npm test` → green, proving the contract still holds.
